##Page 3 Introduction
xp_furniture:book.contents.13=§lObtaining Furniture§r
xp_furniture:book.contents.14=You can use the crafting table recipe book to view the available furniture you can craft in survival mode, or by getting them in the creative inventory.

##Page 4 Debug Hammer
xp_furniture:book.contents.15=§lHammer§r
xp_furniture:book.contents.16=An item for setting block states and breaking down furniture immediately by pressing attack in survival or creative mode. Interact to cycle different states on targeted blocks. Interact + sneak to apply the previously selected state to the block.

## [ ] increment page numbers in comments
## [ ] increment text content +2
## [ ] increment actual text comment in structure SNBT

##Page 5 Introduction
xp_furniture:book.contents.17=§lFurniture Merchant§r
xp_furniture:book.contents.18=A new merchant has set foot in your world! Make sure not to miss his trade offers for furniture, crops, and plants when he visits you.

##Page 6 2.0 Update
xp_furniture:book.contents.19=§lPlushies: §rAdorable plushies of various mobs! Armadillo, cat, wolf, fox, and mooshroom added.
xp_furniture:book.contents.20=§lStove and Cooking Pan: §rInteract with coal to turn on the stove. Add cooking pan and raw food to cook!

##Page 7 2.0 Update
xp_furniture:book.contents.21=§lPlaceable Food: §rAll the existing food added as placeable items! Adds a consumable pumpkin slice to the inventory.
xp_furniture:book.contents.22=§lSaplings: §rSix new variants added including willow, dogwood, and wisteria!

##Page 8 2.0 Update
xp_furniture:book.contents.23=§lHanging Leaves: §rWisteria, golden chain, and willow leaves added!
xp_furniture:book.contents.24=§lWatering Can: §rA decorative placeable watering can. Watering can can now be filled and used to water plants.

##Page 9 2.0 Update
xp_furniture:book.contents.25=§lRoof Types: §rCopper roof type and new roof tip blocks that automatically connect added in 2.0!
xp_furniture:book.contents.26=§lPet Bed: §rA comfy bed for your beloved pets available in all dye colors. The pet bed allows pets to sit inside them to heal now!

##Page 10 Update
xp_furniture:book.contents.27=§lInstruments: §rA range of playable musical instruments. Pianos and panflutes now added!
xp_furniture:book.contents.28=§lAquarium: §rA sweet home for your aquatic pets. Fill with water or fish in a bucket. Axolotl and tadpoles added!

##Page 11 Update
xp_furniture:book.contents.29=§lButterflies and Moths: §rButterflies and moths added as catchable with the bug net.
xp_furniture:book.contents.30=§lBug's Net: §rBug's Net added which can be used to attack or to catch butterflies and moths.

##Page 12 Update
xp_furniture:book.contents.31=§lStone Walls and Slabs: §rAndesite, calcite, diorite, and granite walls added in two sizes.
xp_furniture:book.contents.32=§lWood Planks: §rAdditional wooden plank variants in all wood types. Pale Oak Variants now added!

##Page 13 Update
xp_furniture:book.contents.33=§lTool Rack: §rOrganize and display your tools with this handy rack. Fishing rod, trident and bow can now be added!
xp_furniture:book.contents.34=§lTable Lamps: §rTable lamps in all wood types. Interact to turn on and off.

##Page 14 Update
xp_furniture:book.contents.35=§lBook Piles: §rTwo books stacked horizontally or vertically. An additional two books can now be stacked.
xp_furniture:book.contents.36=§lParasol: §rColorful parasols in three colors, perfect for sunny days. The parasol can now be closed and opened.

##Page 15 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.37=§lQueen-Sized Bed: §rBigger, fancier, and cozier beds in all wood types and colors. Interact when it's dark and skip the night.
xp_furniture:book.contents.38=§lTable: §rTables in various styles and sizes, ranging from small to fits-an-entire-sniffer-big.

##Page 16 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.39=§lChairs and Stools: §rComfortable chairs and stools in all wood types. Interact to sit.
xp_furniture:book.contents.40=§lSofa: §rCozy sofas in all colors with room for three players. Interact to sit anywhere on the sofa.

##Page 17 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.41=§lArmchair and Cushions: §rIncredibly comfy armchairs and bouncy cushions in all colors. Interact to sit.
xp_furniture:book.contents.42=§lBench: §rSpacious benches in all wood types with room for two players. Interact to sit anywhere on the bench.

##Page 18 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.43=§lBedside Tables: §rCompact bedside tables in all wood types. Interact to open its storage.
xp_furniture:book.contents.44=§lBroom: §rA simple broom for display made out of wood and hay.

##Page 19 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.45=§lGlobe: §rDecorative globes both in colored and wood-carved variants. Interact to spin the globe.
xp_furniture:book.contents.46=§lGrandfather Clock: §rMajestic clocks in two sizes and wood types, shows you the right time and chimes at designated times.

##Page 20 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.47=§lUrns: §rVarious decorative urns in different shapes and sizes.
xp_furniture:book.contents.48=§lTelescope: §rThe decorative bigger brother of the regular spyglass.

##Page 21 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.49=§lCamera: §rA standing camera that snaps unique photos that can be displayed in picture frames. Interact to snap a photo.
xp_furniture:book.contents.50=§lPicture Frame: §rPlaceable pictures made of the polaroids you receive from the camera.

##Page 22 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.51=§lChests and Wardrobes: §rTwo new chests and fancy wardrobes in all wood types! Interact to access its inventory.
xp_furniture:book.contents.52=§lDisplay Case: §rDisplay cases to showcase your valuable items. Interact while holding an item to showcase it.

##Page 23 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.53=§lStanding and Ceiling Lamps: §rStanding and ceiling lamps in all wood types. Interact to turn on and off.
xp_furniture:book.contents.54=§lRoom Divider: §rStylish dividers in two variants to separate spaces within rooms.

##Page 24 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.55=§lCarpet: §rDecorative carpets with eight different unique patterns.
xp_furniture:book.contents.56=§lCandelabra, Chandeliers and Candle Holders: §rCandle holders in various looks and materials. Interact with Flint and Steel to light!

##Page 25 Kitchen
xp_furniture:book.contents.57=§lCounter & Cabinet: §rSturdy work surfaces in all wood types that will hold all your ingredients. Interact to open its storage.
xp_furniture:book.contents.58=§lSink: §rFunctional sinks for kitchens and bathrooms. Be sure to regularly wash your hands!

##Page 26 Kitchen
xp_furniture:book.contents.59=§lCookie Jar: §rA cute jar for storing cookies. Interact while holding a cookie to store it inside the jar.
xp_furniture:book.contents.60=§lCauldron: §rA big bubble cauldron in three different variants.

##Page 27 Kitchen
xp_furniture:book.contents.61=§lMug: §rA simple decorative wooden mug. Combining the mug with any vegetable crafts it into a drinkable Juice Mug.

##Page 28 Walls and Hanging Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.62=§lShelf: §rSimple shelves in all wood types for displaying any items you might want to show off.
xp_furniture:book.contents.63=§lWindow Frame: §rVersatile frames in all wood types, whether it be for windows or as a picture frame.

##Page 29 Walls and Hanging Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.64=§lHanging Landmark Sign: §rHanging signs in all wood types. Interact to switch symbols!
xp_furniture:book.contents.65=§lPlain and Pattern Wallpaper: §rClean wallpapers and decorative pattern wallpapers in all colors!

##Page 30 Walls and Hanging Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.66=§lCurtains and Blinds: §rWooden adjustable blinds and elegant curtains in two sizes to add a cozy touch to windows. Interact to open and close.

##Page 31 Outdoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.67=§lWater Pump: §rAn iron water pump. Interact to pump water or interact while holding an empty bucket to fill it with water.
xp_furniture:book.contents.68=§lWind Wheel and Wind Chime: §rWind wheels and wind chimes that animate in the breeze.

##Page 32 Outdoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.69=§lHammock and Rocking Chair: §rA cozy hammock in four different colors and a classic rocking chair for relaxation.  Interact to sit.
xp_furniture:book.contents.70=§lJuice Barrel: §rThe bigger brother of the regular barrel.

##Page 33 Outdoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.71=§lWooden Cart and Windmill: §rA rustic decorative cart in two different sizes. A big rotating windmill to add life to your scenery.
xp_furniture:book.contents.72=§lWater Wheel: §rA picturesque big water wheel- great for scenic spots! Only turns in water.

##Page 34 Nature and Garden
xp_furniture:book.contents.73=§lChicken Nest: §rPlace an egg into the chicken nest and with enough patience, a chicken will eventually spawn.
xp_furniture:book.contents.74=§lFallen Leaves and Leaf Piles: §rDecorative scattered leaves and a pile of leaves sitting on the ground, perfect for autumn settings.

##Page 35 Nature and Garden
xp_furniture:book.contents.75=§lFlowerpot: §rCharming flower pots in various designs. Interact while holding any plant or flower to place them inside.
xp_furniture:book.contents.76=§lFountain: §rLittle water fountains in iron and diorite variants. Interact to turn water on and off.

##Page 36 Nature and Garden
xp_furniture:book.contents.77=§lLog Stack and Baskets: §rDecorative logs and functional baskets holding specific foods!
xp_furniture:book.contents.78=§lFlower Box: §rPlanter boxes in various designs. Interact with any plant to place it inside.

##Page 37 Nature and Garden
xp_furniture:book.contents.79=§lGrow Lamp: §rA decorative copper lamp for your indoor gardening areas. Interact to toggle.
xp_furniture:book.contents.80=§lScarecrow and Haystack: §rA decorative scarecrow and haystacks to keep your crops company.

##Page 38 Nature and Garden
xp_furniture:book.contents.81=§lSprinkler: §rA functional sprinkler to grow your crops. Fill with water bucket and interact to start the sprinkler.
xp_furniture:book.contents.82=§lLeaf Blocks: §rMore decorative leaf blocks to add to your vegetation heavy environments.

##Page 39 Nature and Garden
xp_furniture:book.contents.83=§lCrops: §rGrow a variety of new crops like tomatoes and bell peppers. Seeds purchasable from the furniture merchant.
xp_furniture:book.contents.84=§lPlants: §rA big variety of plants, including large and small plants. Purchasable from the furniture merchant.

##Page 40 Building and Decor
xp_furniture:book.contents.85=§lDecorative Stairs and Door Frames: §rSingle and double door frames and a new stair variant in all wood types!
xp_furniture:book.contents.86=§lRope and Pipes: §rClimbable ropes and decorative pipes with a custom connection system!

##Page 41 Building and Decor
xp_furniture:book.contents.87=§lDecorative Fence & Gate: §rA new fence and fence gate in all wood types. Interact to open and close the gate.
xp_furniture:book.contents.88=§lBeams and Supports: §rWooden supports and connective beams in all wood types.

##Page 42 Building and Decor
xp_furniture:book.contents.89=§lPlaceable Objects: §rVarious regular items that can be placed around for added detail.
xp_furniture:book.contents.90=§lBarred Door: §rA huge, heavy door that can be locked from both sides. Sneak + Interact to lock and unlock.

##Page 43 Building and Decor
xp_furniture:book.contents.91=§lRoof Tiles and Trim Glass: §rVarious types of different roof tiles. Decorative glass blocks as well as slanted roof blocks with colored trims.
xp_furniture:book.contents.92=§lNew Paths: §rThree new paths to choose from made of wood, stone, and bricks.

##Page 44 Building and Decor
xp_furniture:book.contents.93=§lStone Types and Tile Blocks: §rMore building blocks for all rock types like andesite and diorite. Tiled designs of several different material combinations.

